If a clinician dismisses a patient on a toxicology-result-basis then the clinician can cause an adverse-patient-safety-consequence.
If a clinician dismisses a patient on a toxicology-result-basis then the patient can potentially obtain an opioid-or-other-drug from an alternative-source.
If a clinician dismisses a patient on a toxicology-result-basis then the clinician can potentially miss a substance-use-disorder-treatment-facilitation-opportunity.
